source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Extension authoring commands

Usage: specforge extension <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init      Scaffold an extension crate written with the SDK
  build     Build the extension's component (cargo build --release --target wasm32-wasip2)
  validate  Load the built component and report its declaration's diagnostics
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
